{"ordinal":12912,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688263","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Death_047b2b2","source":"Provocateur: НЕ-Е-Е-Е-ЕТ!!!","target":"Provocateur: NU-U-U-U!!!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12913,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688262","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Death_0e61d9f","source":"Provocateur: Стойте, не надо!","target":"Provocateur: Stați, nu faceți asta!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12914,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688261","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Death_0cb9660","source":"Provocateur: Подождите, вы что, правда нажмёте на курок…","target":"Provocateur: Așteptați, chiar o să apăsați pe trăgaci…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12915,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688260","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_DontShoot_01adf79","source":"Provocateur: Какого чёрта вы каждый раз достаёте ружьё? В чём странность иметь серу в ушах? Куда катиться мир…","target":"Provocateur: De ce naiba scoateți pușca de fiecare dată? Ce e ciudat în a avea ceară în urechi? Unde a ajuns lumea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12916,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688259","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_DontShoot_0a55aad","source":"Provocateur: Если вы ждёте благодарности за то, что не снесли мне полбашки, то напрасно.","target":"Provocateur: Dacă așteptați să vă mulțumesc că nu mi-ați zburat jumătate din cap, vă înșelați.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12917,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688258","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_DontShoot_0490979","source":"Provocateur: Дожили…","target":"Provocateur: În ce hal am ajuns…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12918,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688257","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_DontShoot_020e609","source":"Provocateur: По вашему мнению, я должен не брить подмышки, чтобы вы не тыкали в меня ружьём?","target":"Provocateur: După dumneavoastră, n-ar trebui să-mi rad axilele ca să nu mai îndreptați pușca spre mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12919,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453134688256","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_DontShoot_0ee0d57","source":"Provocateur: Вы так скоро меня до седых волос доведёте!","target":"Provocateur: În curând o să-mi albiți părul!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12920,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493961","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_DontShoot_00daad5","source":"Provocateur: Прекращайте этот цирк, нет никаких Гостей!","target":"Provocateur: Terminați cu circul ăsta, nu există Musafiri!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12921,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493960","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Eyes_DontShoot_0436b18","source":"Provocateur: Вы вообще нормальный? Сначала наставили ружьё, а потом убрали, будто ничего и не было. Псих!","target":"Provocateur: Sunteți întreg la minte? Mai întâi ați îndreptat pușca spre mine, apoi ați lăsat-o jos, ca și cum nimic nu s-ar fi întâmplat. Psihopatule!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12922,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493959","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Hands_DontShoot_035978b","source":"Provocateur: Не надо при малейшей несостыковке доставать ружьё!","target":"Provocateur: Nu mai scoateți pușca la cea mai mică nepotrivire!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12923,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493958","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Teeth_DontShoot_0c07698","source":"Provocateur: Зачем вы вообще к себе пускаете людей, если так легко готовы их убить? Грёбаный маньяк!","target":"Provocateur: De ce mai lăsați oameni să intre dacă sunteți gata să-i ucideți atât de ușor? Maniac nenorocit!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12924,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493957","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Teeth_DontShoot_0fda0a6","source":"Provocateur: Надо же, крупицы здравых мыслей у вас всё-таки остались!","target":"Provocateur: Ia te uită, v-au mai rămas câteva fărâme de judecată!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12925,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493956","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_Gun_0eec4c6","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12926,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493955","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_Gun_0c64ec7","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12927,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493954","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_Gun_0894b53","source":"Provocateur: Или вы считаете, что выстрел из ружья как-то поможет прочистить мне уши?","target":"Provocateur: Sau credeți că un glonț din pușcă îmi va desfunda cumva urechile?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12928,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493953","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_Gun_0ce6adc","source":"Provocateur: Может, вы перестанете при малейшей несостыковке со сказанным по телевизору тыкать в людей ружьём!?","target":"Provocateur: Poate nu mai îndreptați pușca spre oameni la cea mai mică abatere de la ce s-a spus la televizor!?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12929,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453130493952","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_00bbc5b","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12930,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299657","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_0799de9","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12931,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299656","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_0978b12","source":"Provocateur: Гениально! В этом вообще нет логики, но действительно, давайте и этому верить.","target":"Provocateur: Genial! N-are niciun pic de logică, dar sigur, hai să credem și asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12932,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299655","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_00c63f4","source":"Provocateur: …","target":"Provocateur: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12933,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299654","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_009c075","source":"Provocateur: По-вашему, так называемые Гости бреют подмышки, находясь под землёй?","target":"Provocateur: După dumneavoastră, așa-zișii Musafiri își rad axilele cât stau sub pământ?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12934,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299653","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Armpit_Gun_0f9182a","source":"Provocateur: Вы в своём уме? Каким боком бритые подмышки доказывают, что я — Гость?","target":"Provocateur: Sunteți întreg la minte? Cum naiba dovedesc axilele rase că sunt Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12935,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299652","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_Gun_0f49423","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12936,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299651","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_Gun_06b4fcc","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12937,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299650","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_Gun_04738c1","source":"Provocateur: С таким же успехом можете подбрасыванием монетки решать, кого вы убьёте следующим.","target":"Provocateur: La fel de bine ați putea da cu banul ca să hotărâți pe cine omorâți după aceea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12938,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299649","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_Gun_073c63b","source":"Provocateur: Да вы издеваетесь!? Вы по фотографии «ауры» хотите определять людей?","target":"Provocateur: Glumiți!? Vreți să judecați oamenii după fotografia „aurei”?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12939,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453126299648","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_Gun_05fcbd5","source":"Provocateur: Да вы издеваетесь!? Я что, дёрнулся на фотке, и вам это кажется подозрительным?","target":"Provocateur: Glumiți!? M-am mișcat în fotografie și vi se pare suspect?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12940,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105351","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Eyes_Gun_07a6a87","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12941,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105350","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Eyes_Gun_04fb0cd","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12942,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105349","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Eyes_Gun_00908a7","source":"Provocateur: Серьёзно!? А сейчас что не так?","target":"Provocateur: Serios!? Și acum ce nu e în regulă?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12943,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105348","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Hands_Gun_0c1e601","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12944,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105347","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Hands_Gun_085d9a4","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12945,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105346","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Hands_Gun_02b745d","source":"Provocateur: А сейчас-то что не так?","target":"Provocateur: Și acum ce nu e în regulă?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12946,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105345","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Hands_Gun_04b6dd8","source":"Provocateur: Какого хрена!? Грязь под ногтями теперь означает, что я Гость?","target":"Provocateur: Ce dracu’!? Murdăria de sub unghii înseamnă acum că sunt Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-324.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12947,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453122105344","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Teeth_Gun_0861084","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12948,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453117911045","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Teeth_Gun_02d5b8a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
