{"ordinal":12950,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453117911043","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Teeth_Gun_09f7cae","source":"Provocateur: Ну конечно, меньшего я и не ждал от вас.","target":"Provocateur: Bineînțeles, nici nu mă așteptam la altceva din partea dumneavoastră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12951,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453117911042","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_04e7a92","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12952,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453117911041","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_0f4b1a7","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12953,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453117911040","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_053f573","source":"Provocateur: Тебе в доктора захотелось поиграть? И как? Ушные пробки есть? Что пропишите, господин доктор?","target":"Provocateur: Ți s-a făcut chef să te joci de-a doctorul? Și? Am dopuri de ceară în urechi? Ce-mi prescrii, domnule doctor?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12954,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716744","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_00d2fd9","source":"Provocateur: ...","target":"Provocateur: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12955,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716743","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_01711fd","source":"Provocateur: А если скажут, что лобковые волосы – это новый признак, будете со всех штаны спускать!?","target":"Provocateur: Și dacă spun că părul pubian e un semn nou, o să le dați tuturor pantalonii jos!?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12956,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716742","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Ears_01e7dd3","source":"Provocateur: Боже, вы верите всему, что говорят по телевизору?","target":"Provocateur: Doamne, chiar credeți tot ce se spune la televizor?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12957,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716741","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_0a3d478","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12958,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716740","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_0293d37","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12959,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716739","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_02e98d8","source":"Provocateur: ...","target":"Provocateur: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12960,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716738","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_0786164","source":"Provocateur: Нет, правда, почему бы не сфотографировать меня. Это же точно что-то докажет.","target":"Provocateur: Nu, serios, de ce să nu-mi faceți o fotografie? Sigur o să dovedească ceva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":12961,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453113716737","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Provocateur_Photo_0ac7c32","source":"Provocateur: Ах фотографию вам надо… Может, мне ещё для вас улыбнуться?","target":"Provocateur: Ah, vă trebuie o fotografie… Poate vreți să vă și zâmbesc?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-325.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
